      "content": "<h3>8. clone, equals and toString</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Signature:</strong> <code>Object clone();  boolean equals(Object);  String toString()</code></li>\n<li><strong>Returns:</strong> a shallow copy / comparison / text</li>\n<li><strong>Time:</strong> O(n)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>For freshers:</strong> A LinkedHashMap is <strong>equal</strong> to any other <code>Map</code> with the same pairs; the order is <strong>ignored</strong> by <code>equals</code>. <code>toString</code> prints the pairs in order.</p>\n<p><strong>For experienced developers:</strong> Copy with <code>new LinkedHashMap&lt;&gt;(map)</code> to keep the order of the source map.</p>",
